ARITY</span></h3><h1 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-bOQUxc cBnkcD pf-25_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kuVMvl bBmUMO pf-27_">Our Mission</span></h1><p class="sc-eBwJYS dJbEKt pf-28_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kuVMvl bBmUMO pf-30_"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"></span>Howard’s Folly is born in the high-altitude region of Portalegre, Alentejo — where cooler climates allow grapes to mature slowly, creating wines of elegance, balance and distinct character.Founded in 2005 by Howard Bilton and renowned winemaker David Baverstock, the project combines international vision with Portuguese terroir to produce wines recognised by leading critics worldwide.<span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
